coloured dice are thrown once. The six faces of", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.14685314685314685}, {"text": "the blue die are numbered 4, 6, 8, 9, 10 and 12. The six faces of the pink die are", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.15073815073815075, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.16394716394716394}, {"text": "numbered 2, 3, 5,7, 11 and 13. The player wins if the number on the pink die is", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.16705516705516704, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "larger than the number on the blue die.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.18492618492618493, "x1": 0.48021978021978023, "y1": 0.19735819735819735}, {"text": "@", "x0": 0.18681318681318682, "y0": 0.21756021756021757, "x1": 0.2032967032967033, "y1": 0.22999222999222999}, {"text": "By drawing up a table of possible outcomes, or otherwise, calculate the", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.21756021756021757, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.23076923076923078}, {"text": "probability of the player winning a game.", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.2338772338772339, "x1": 0.5615384615384615, "y1": 0.24708624708624707}, {"text": "Gi)", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.26728826728826727, "x1": 0.2043956043956044, "y1": 0.27972027972027974}, {"text": "Calculate the probability that the player wins at least once in two", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.26728826728826727, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.2804972804972805}, {"text": "successive games.", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.2867132867132867, "x1": 0.37142857142857144, "y1": 0.29681429681429683}, {"text": "(b) A fish farmer began business on | January 1998 with a stock of 100 000 fish. He", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3341103341103341, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.3473193473193473}, {"text": "had a contract to supply 15 400 fish at a price of $10 per fish to a retailer in", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.3504273504273504, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}, {"text": "December each year. In the period between January and the harvest in December", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.36752136752136755, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.38073038073038074}, {"text": "each year, the number of fish increases by 10%.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.3838383838383838, "x1": 0.5538461538461539, "y1": 0.39704739704739705}, {"text": "@", "x0": 0.18681318681318682, "y0": 0.4172494172494173, "x1": 0.2032967032967033, "y1": 0.4296814296814297}, {"text": "Find the number of fish just after the second harvest in December 1999.", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.4172494172494173, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.43045843045843046}, {"text": "Gi)", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.4506604506604507, "x1": 0.2032967032967033, "y1": 0.4630924630924631}, {"text": "the number of fish just after the nth harvest, is given by", "x0": 0.34615384615384615, "y0": 0.4506604506604507, "x1": 0.7956043956043956, "y1": 0.46386946386946387}, {"text": "Show that F,", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.45143745143745145, "x1": 0.3252747252747253, "y1": 0.46076146076146074}, {"text": "F,, = 154.000 54 000(1-1)\".", "x0": 0.3989010989010989, "y0": 0.48329448329448327, "x1": 0.6351648351648351, "y1": 0.4988344988344988}, {"text": "(iii)", "x0": 0.17582417582417584, "y0": 0.5174825174825175, "x1": 0.2043956043956044, "y1": 0.5299145299145299}, {"text": "When will the farmer have sold all his fish, and what will his total", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5174825174825175, "x1": 0.8076923076923077, "y1": 0.5291375291375291}, {"text": "income be?", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.5345765345765345, "x1": 0.31868131868131866, "y1": 0.5439005439005439}, {"text": "(iv)", "x0": 0.17692307692307693, "y0": 0.5672105672105672, "x1": 0.2043956043956044, "y1": 0.5796425796425796}, {"text": "Each December the retailer offers to buy the farmer\u2019s business by paying", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5672105672105672, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.5804195804195804}, {"text": "$15 per fish for his entire stock. When should the farmer sell to", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.5843045843045843, "x1": 0.8087912087912088, "y1": 0.5975135975135976}, {"text": "maximise his total income?", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.6006216006216006, "x1": 0.44835164835164837, "y1": 0.6107226107226107}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44285714285714284, "y0": 0.6845376845376845, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.6977466977466977}], [{"text": "12", "x0": 0.49340659340659343, "y0": 0.041181041181041184, "x1": 0.5087912087912088, "y1": 0.050505050505050504}, {"text": "STANDARD INTEGRALS", "x0": 0.38351648351648354, "y0": 0.08391608391608392, "x1": 0.6153846153846154, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "=x, x40, ifn<0", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.1250971250971251, "x1": 0.7307692307692307, "y1": 0.1445221445221445}, {"text": "n+l", "x0": 0.44835164835164837, "y0": 0.1414141414141414, "x1": 0.4824175824175824, "y1": 0.15073815073815075}, {"text": "1", "x0": 0.2923076923076923, "y0": 0.1888111888111888, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.19813519813519814}, {"text": "=Inx, x>0", "x0": 0.42967032967032964, "y0": 0.19813519813519814, "x1": 0.5373626373626373, "y1": 0.20823620823620823}, {"text": "x", "x0": 0.2923076923076923, "y0": 0.20901320901320902, "x1": 0.2989010989010989, "y1": 0.21522921522921523}, {"text": "eM de", "x0": 0.2868131868131868, "y0": 0.2602952602952603, "x1": 0.33516483516483514, "y1": 0.27117327117327117}, {"text": "1.", "x0": 0.45164835164835165, "y0": 0.317016317016317, "x1": 0.4736263736263736, "y1": 0.3271173271173271}, {"text": "cosaxdx = qsinax, a#0", "x0": 0.2879120879120879, "y0": 0.32556332556332557, "x1": 0.5703296703296703, "y1": 0.3434343434343434}, {"text": "1", "x0": 0.46483516483516485, "y0": 0.3815073815073815, "x1": 0.46923076923076923, "y1": 0.39083139083139085}, {"text": "a#0", "x0": 0.5461538461538461, "y0": 0.3900543900543901, "x1": 0.5